Bugfix: Report errors from closing restored files

Restic restore ignored errors returned when closing the files it had
written. A close that fails can leave a file whose last writes never reached
the disk, so `restic restore` could report success over missing data. It now
reports the first such error and exits non-zero.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/22179
https://github.com/restic/restic/pull/22226
